    "A 1–100 rank among players in the same season, season type, and stat category. Higher is always better after lower-is-better stats are inverted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 1–100 rank among players in the same season, season type, and stat category. Higher is always better after lower-is-better stats are inverted."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puesto del 1 al 100 entre jugadores de la misma temporada, fase y categoría. Un valor más alto siempre es mejor, incluso en estadísticas invertidas."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rang von 1 bis 100 unter Spielern derselben Saison, Phase und Statistikkategorie. Höher ist immer besser, auch bei umgekehrten Werten."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Score van 1 tot 100 onder spelers in hetzelfde seizoen, dezelfde fase en statistiekcategorie. Hoger is altijd beter, ook bij omgekeerde statistieken."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Posizione da 1 a 100 tra giocatori della stessa stagione, fase e categoria. Un valore più alto è sempre migliore, anche per le statistiche invertite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A counting stat at zero. When most of the league has none of something, a tie at zero has no honest percentile, so the value shows and the bar does not.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A counting stat at zero. When most of the league has none of something, a tie at zero has no honest percentile, so the value shows and the bar does not."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una estadística de conteo en cero. Si casi nadie de la liga registra ese dato, un empate en cero no tiene un percentil útil: se muestra el valor, pero no la barra."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Zählstatistik mit dem Wert null. Wenn die meisten in der Liga keinen Wert haben, ist ein Gleichstand bei null kein sinnvolles Perzentil. Der Wert erscheint, aber kein Balken."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een telstatistiek op nul. Als de meeste spelers niets scoren, zegt een gelijke stand op nul niets zinnigs over het percentiel. De waarde blijft staan, de balk niet."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una statistica di conteggio a zero. Se quasi nessuno in lega registra quel dato, un pari a zero non ha un percentile significativo. Il valore resta visibile, la barra no."
          }
        }
      }
    },
