    "Below the playing-time minimum for that stat, prorated by how much of the season the typical team has played. Defenders need a quarter of their team's defensive snaps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Below the playing-time minimum for that stat, prorated by how much of the season the typical team has played. Defenders need a quarter of their team's defensive snaps."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por debajo del mínimo de participación para esa estadística, ajustado al avance típico de la temporada. Los defensivos necesitan una cuarta parte de los snaps defensivos de su equipo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter dem Mindestspielanteil für diese Statistik, angepasst an den Saisonfortschritt eines typischen Teams. Defensive Spieler brauchen ein Viertel der Defensiv-Snaps ihres Teams."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onder de minimale speeltijd voor die statistiek, afgestemd op hoe ver een gemiddeld team in het seizoen is. Verdedigers moeten minstens een kwart van de defensive snaps van hun team hebben."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sotto il minimo di impiego per quella statistica, proporzionato alla stagione media di una squadra. I difensori devono aver giocato almeno un quarto degli snap difensivi della squadra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
