    "Production against pay for every qualified player.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Production against pay for every qualified player."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Producción comparada con el sueldo de cada jugador calificado."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leistung im Vergleich zum Gehalt für jeden qualifizierten Spieler."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Productie tegenover salaris voor elke gekwalificeerde speler."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Produzione a confronto con l'ingaggio per ogni giocatore qualificato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Production percentile minus pay percentile, both ranked among this season's qualified players at the position who have an active contract. Pay is the deal's yearly average as a share of the salary cap when it was signed. +20 means producing like a player paid far more. Quarterbacks, running backs, receivers and tight ends for now. Contracts: OverTheCap via nflverse.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Production percentile minus pay percentile, both ranked among this season's qualified players at the position who have an active contract. Pay is the deal's yearly average as a share of the salary cap when it was signed. +20 means producing like a player paid far more. Quarterbacks, running backs, receivers and tight ends for now. Contracts: OverTheCap via nflverse."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Percentil de producción menos percentil salarial, ambos entre los jugadores calificados de esta temporada en la posición que tienen contrato vigente. El salario es el promedio anual del contrato como proporción del tope salarial al firmarlo. +20 significa que rinde como un jugador con un sueldo mucho mayor. Por ahora incluye quarterbacks, running backs, receptores y tight ends. Contratos: OverTheCap vía nflverse."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Produktionsperzentil minus Gehaltsperzentil, jeweils im Vergleich zu den qualifizierten Spielern dieser Saison auf der Position mit aktivem Vertrag. Das Gehalt ist der Jahresdurchschnitt des Vertrags als Anteil des Salary Caps bei Vertragsabschluss. +20 heißt: Die Leistung entspricht einem deutlich höher bezahlten Spieler. Aktuell für Quarterbacks, Runningbacks, Receiver und Tight Ends. Verträge: OverTheCap via nflverse."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Productiepercentiel min salarispercentiel, beide vergeleken met gekwalificeerde spelers op die positie met een actief contract dit seizoen. Het salaris is het jaargemiddelde van het contract als deel van de salary cap bij ondertekening. +20 betekent dat de productie past bij een veel hoger betaald salaris. Voor nu: quarterbacks, running backs, receivers en tight ends. Contracten: OverTheCap via nflverse."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Percentile di produzione meno percentile dello stipendio, entrambi confrontati con i giocatori qualificati nel ruolo con contratto attivo in questa stagione. Lo stipendio è la media annua del contratto come quota del salary cap alla firma. +20 indica una produzione da giocatore molto più pagato. Per ora: quarterback, running back, ricevitori e tight end. Contratti: OverTheCap via nflverse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Projected margins come from StatScout Power Ratings: each club's efficiency and scoring against an average team, adjusted for schedule, plus two points for home field. Details on the Teams tab.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projected margins come from StatScout Power Ratings: each club's efficiency and scoring against an average team, adjusted for schedule, plus two points for home field. Details on the Teams tab."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los márgenes proyectados vienen de los Power Ratings de StatScout: eficiencia y puntos de cada equipo frente a un equipo promedio, ajustados por calendario, más dos puntos por localía. Más detalles en Equipos."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prognosen stammen aus den StatScout Power Ratings: Effizienz und Punkte eines Teams im Vergleich zu einem durchschnittlichen Team, spielplanbereinigt, plus zwei Punkte Heimvorteil. Details unter Teams."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwachte marges komen van de StatScout Power Ratings: efficiëntie en score van elk team tegenover een gemiddeld team, aangepast aan het speelschema, plus twee punten thuisvoordeel. Meer op Teams."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I margini previsti derivano dai Power Rating di StatScout: efficienza e punti di ogni squadra rispetto a una squadra media, corretti per calendario, più due punti per il fattore campo. Dettagli in Squadre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
