    "Totals add up the current roster's season lines, so a player traded at the deadline brings his whole year with him. Volume bars rank each club per game.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Totals add up the current roster's season lines, so a player traded at the deadline brings his whole year with him. Volume bars rank each club per game."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los totales suman los registros de temporada de la plantilla actual. Un jugador traspasado a mitad de temporada aporta todo su año. Las barras de volumen comparan producción por partido."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Summen addieren die Saisonwerte des aktuellen Kaders. Ein Spieler, der zur Trade Deadline wechselt, bringt sein ganzes Jahr mit. Volumenbalken vergleichen Teams pro Spiel."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Totalen tellen seizoensregels van de huidige selectie op. Een speler die rond de deadline is geruild, neemt zijn hele jaar mee. Volumebalken rangschikken clubs per wedstrijd."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I totali sommano le statistiche stagionali del roster attuale. Un giocatore scambiato a stagione in corso porta con sé tutto l'anno. Le barre confrontano il volume a partita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Totals sum the selected roster's player season lines. Traded players bring their full-season line, so these are roster aggregates rather than official team totals.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Totals sum the selected roster's player season lines. Traded players bring their full-season line, so these are roster aggregates rather than official team totals."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los totales suman las estadísticas de temporada de los jugadores seleccionados. Los traspasados conservan todo el año, así que son agregados de plantilla, no totales oficiales del equipo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Summen addieren die Saisonwerte der gewählten Spieler. Getradete Spieler bringen ihre ganze Saison mit, daher sind es Kadersummen und keine offiziellen Teamwerte."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Totalen tellen seizoensregels van de geselecteerde spelers op. Geruilde spelers tellen hun hele seizoen mee, dus dit zijn selectietotalen en geen officiële teamtotalen."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I totali sommano le statistiche stagionali dei giocatori scelti. Gli scambiati portano l'intera stagione, quindi sono totali del roster e non ufficiali della squadra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
